that said, it&#x27;s _really_ easy to have executables against random sdist with `uv run --with`.<p>here&#x27;s something that i was writing just yesterday:<p><pre><code>    #!&#x2F;usr&#x2F;bin&#x2F;env bash
    PYSTABLE=&quot;3.13&quot;
    SERVER=&quot;...&quot;
    PACKAGE=&quot;xyz&quot;
    VERSION=&quot;0.1.3&quot;
    exec uv run --python &quot;$PYSTABLE&quot; --with &quot;$SERVER&#x2F;$PKG-$VERSION.tar.gz&quot; &quot;$PKG&quot; &quot;$@&quot;</code></pre>
